WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Take action

2
00:00:02,470 --> 00:00:03,870
Really looking for death

3
00:00:07,470 --> 00:00:14,060
You Chu State coward

4
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:16,740
Just wait for the Northern Barbarian army to invade the border, right?

5
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,980
Could it be that you are the Great Khan of the Northern Barbarians?

6
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:21,340
Sooner or later, I, the Great Khan of the Northern Barbarians, will bring the iron flag.

7
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:23,020
Destroy every inch of land in Chu State

8
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:24,020
The matter of sending troops

9
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,820
Can you, a messenger, be the master?

10
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:27,540
The affairs of the Northern Barbarians have nothing to do with me

11
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:30,420
Now let's settle the score between you and me

12
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:31,940
I am the messenger of the Northern Barbarians

13
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:33,100
If you dare, do it

14
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:34,500
According to the rules tonight

15
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:36,820
Miss Ping'er is already my guest

16
00:00:37,870 --> 00:00:39,750
You stole someone from me

17
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:41,430
How to calculate this account?

18
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:45,490
You all heard it

19
00:00:45,810 --> 00:00:47,410
It was he who asked me to take action

20
00:00:47,530 --> 00:00:50,140
Show mercy to the young master

21
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:51,340
Don't take your life
